        "features": [
          "【Instant Stylus for HP Touchscreen Laptops】 Engineered for seamless compatibility with most HP models, including Omnibook X Flip, Envy x360, Spectre x360, and Pavilion x360 (Please refer to the compatibility chart before purchase). Simply insert a battery and start writing—no Bluetooth pairing, driver installation, or software setup required.",
          "【Smart Palm Rejection Technology】 Write and draw naturally with your hand resting flat on the screen. The stylus automatically detects and ignores accidental skin contact, eliminating smudges and distractions for a true paper-like creative experience.",
          "【Professional 1024 Pressure Sensitivity】 Experience pixel-perfect precision with 1024 levels of pressure sensitivity, delivering natural line variation from light sketches to bold strokes. Whether you're drawing, note-taking, photo editing, or studying, this stylus transforms your HP laptop into a powerful creative tablet.",
          "【2 Quick-Access Shortcut Buttons】 Speed up your workflow with dedicated left-click erase and right-click functions—perfect for quick edits, note-taking, and presentations. Built-in pen clip keeps your stylus securely attached to notebooks, bags, or pockets, always within reach.",
          "【2-Year Endurance - Create Without Limits】Never worry about your stylus dying mid-task. Powered by a single, widely-available AAAA battery (included), it delivers up to 2 years of uninterrupted use (based on 3 hours of daily use)—so it’s always ready when creativity strikes."
        ]
